  "title": "Frontier Announces Four New Routes Launching Late 2026",
  "summary": "DENVER – July 14, 2026 – Frontier Airlines (Nasdaq: ULCC) announced four new routes today across the United States and Caribbean launching later this year. The routes, which include Denver, Detroit, Fort Lauderdale, Houston, and more, mark the latest growth for the airline as it expands its service, ensuring consumers have affordable travel ...",
